    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόθος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>battle-din</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ εἰ μόθου ἔστ᾽ ἀκόρητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.117
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ μόθον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					158
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶδα δ᾽ ἐπαΐξαι μόθον ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.240
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυσμενέων μόθον οὐ τρέσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.713
				</span></i>
			; generally, <i>fight</i>, between animals, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				191
			</span></i>: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				<u>Eleg.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Semon.
			</span></i>(?) in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLit.Lond.</u>
				53v
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>.</div>
